011-1","isCurrent":false},{"id":"0012","order":12,"layerLabel":"诗句片段","title":"女，同汝。治，治理纺织。周礼太宰:\"以九职任万民………","href":"/shijing/gloss/027-lv-yi/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0012-1","isCurrent":false},{"id":"0013","order":13,"layerLabel":"诗句片段","title":"俾（bǐ），使。訧（yóu），过、错误。陆德明经典释…","href":"/shijing/gloss/027-lv-yi/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0013-1","isCurrent":false},{"id":"0014","order":14,"layerLabel":"诗句片段","title":"韵读：之部——丝、治、就（音怡）。","href":"/shijing/gloss/027-lv-yi/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0014-1","isCurrent":false},{"id":"0015","order":15,"layerLabel":"诗句片段","title":"絺兮綌兮，凄其以风。我思古人，实获我心。","href":"/shijing/gloss/027-lv-yi/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0015-1","isCurrent":false},{"id":"0016","order":16,"layerLabel":"诗句片段","title":"絺（chī），细葛；綌（xì），粗葛。见葛草注。","href":"/shijing/gloss/027-lv-yi/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0016-1","isCurrent":false},{"id":"0017","order":17,"layerLabel":"诗句片段","title":"凄，凉而有寒意。毛传:\"凄，寒风也。\"小雅四月\"秋日…","href":"/shijing/gloss/027-lv-yi/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0017-1","isCurrent":true},{"id":"0018","order":18,"layerLabel":"诗句片段","title":"实获我心，实在能揣度我的心思。羞羞进集笠:\"真能先得…","href":"/shijing/gloss/027-lv-yi/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0018-1","isCurrent":false},{"id":"0019","order":19,"layerLabel":"诗句片段","title":"韵读：侵部——风、心。","href":"/shijing/gloss/027-lv-yi/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0019-1","isCurrent":false}],"previous":{"title":"絺（chī），细葛；綌（xì），粗葛。见葛草注。","href":"/shijing/gloss/027-lv-yi/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0016-1"},"next":{"title":"实获我心，实在能揣度我的心思。羞羞进集笠:\"真能先得…","href":"/shijing/gloss/027-lv-yi/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0018-1"},"gloss":{"key":"0017-1","attributionLabel":"程俊英、蒋见元","sectionLabel":"四章注","text":"凄，凉而有寒意。毛传:\"凄，寒风也。\"小雅四月\"秋日凄凄，百卉具肺\"亦以有寒意释凄。凄其，等于凄凄。以，假借为似，像（从闻一多说）。","notes":null,"id":"0017-1","order":1,"total":1,"annotationId":"0017","parts":[{"id":"part-1","order":1,"excerpt":"凄，凉而有寒意。毛传:\"凄，寒风也。\"小雅四月\"秋日凄凄，百卉具肺\"亦以有寒意释凄。凄其，等于凄凄。以，假借为似，像（从闻一多说）。","anchors":[]}]}}}}
